Open Vanilla 0062: Boss Fights' run features (realm/bossfights/README-run.md). A quick reset after a wipe (everyone up,
full, buffed, back at the start, the boss reset; 10 s, or at once by the raid leader); the leader's pull timer (a ready
check, then a 10 s countdown); the end screen's meters (damage, healing, deaths) and death recap (the last 5 hits);
the ghost split (your best and the record, at the pull); run kinds: practice (Onyxia at 64% / 39%: her phase 2 / 3;
no records, no unlocks), hardcore (one death and you watch; its own board), story (1-5 people, bots, softer; no
records); weekly twists (Blood Moon, Short Fuse, Whelp Swarm, Iron Will) and Raid Roulette; rewards, cosmetic only:
Dragon Scales, Dragon Eggs (five hatch a whelp), the Dragon's Hoard (a transmog look), feats; the Rally Horn; the Hall
of Fame and the Hoard Keeper in Gurubashi (BossFightsNpcs.cpp); a bot fill's Fear Ward / Tremor Totem healer seat for
Onyxia. Rules in BossFightsRunLogic.h (realm/bossfights/tests/test_run.cpp). With bossfights_characters.sql (mode,
twist, feats, stats; bossfights_now's phase, bots, mode, twist, pulled; bossfights_week, bossfights_feat) and
bossfights_world.sql (items 900300-900321, NPCs 900201-900202). On 0001-0061.

